The red was available, and I recorded it in this log the only way a censor can, by swapping
2302741's evidence.ts under HEAD's test file:

  FAIL  unreadable, symlink, and FIFO briefs are skipped; later brief is reached
        [{… "where":"briefs/01-symlink.md","message":"brief cites Behaviour 97 …"},
