== 8. verdict ==

FAIL, round 3, on §5 alone. To be plain about what is and is not wrong: the hardening is
correct, minimal, and in the right place; both HIGHs are really closed (I hung the old rule on a
FIFO and watched the new one skip it); the scanner is equivalent to the regex it replaces across
